  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Link",
    "Sizes",
    "xs (12px)     Inline with helper text or metadata captions.\nsm (14px)     Inline within body copy and dense lists.\nmd (16px)     Standalone links and larger reading contexts.",
    "Icons",
    "Leading icon signals internal navigation (chevron, arrow-left). Trailing icon signals outbound or new-tab (arrow-up-right, external-link). Icon size tracks text size via icon/size/* tokens. If both icons are on, the link is overloaded — keep one.",
    "Rules",
    "Do\n\n• Use for navigation — internal or outbound\n• Keep link text descriptive (\"Read the release notes\", not \"click here\")\n• Pair outbound links with a trailing external-link icon\n• Underline on hover to meet color-alone guidance",
    "Don't\n\n• Don't use Link for actions that mutate state — use Button\n• Don't wrap full paragraphs — link the phrase, not the sentence\n• Don't rely on color alone to signal a link\n• Don't use Link for persistent selection — use a Nav Item"
  ],
  "pageContext": null
